cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below.
  The author list here is for the software; the paper it implements is cited
  under preferred-citation.
title: "SALSA: Substitution Approximation evoLutionary Search and Ab-initio"
abstract: >-
  A high-throughput multistage framework for identifying candidate materials
  that satisfy user-defined target properties, combining ionic-substitution
  composition generation, evolutionary crystal structure prediction, and
  ab-initio validation.
type: software
